{"id":"n41410-1-11","stage":4,"title":"급식 · 供应伙食","scene":"餐饮与生活","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n41410-1-11-1","ko":"빨리 급식 시간이 됐으면 좋겠어.","zh":"希望快点到午餐时间啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"빨리","meaning":"快，赶快","explanation":"빨리：快，赶快","readings":[{"term":"빨리","audio":"/audio/a5443c04aa0fdc08a00a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57305","senseId":"1","lemma":"빨리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"급식","meaning":"供应伙食，供餐，供食","explanation":"급식：供应伙食，供餐，供食","readings":[{"term":"급식","audio":"/audio/b96e814e821f04ede4f1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"41410","senseId":"1","lemma":"급식","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"시간이","meaning":"时间","explanation":"시간：时间；이：用在 아니다、되다 等前，标记否定或变化涉及的身份、状态。","readings":[{"term":"시간","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62841","senseId":"2","lemma":"시간","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"됐으면","meaning":"到","explanation":"되다：到；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；으면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"3","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좋겠어.","meaning":"喜爱，喜欢","explanation":"좋다：喜爱，喜欢；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"10","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"a5443c04aa0fdc08","term":"빨리","zh":"快，赶快","audio":"/audio/a5443c04aa0fdc08a00a.mp3","entryId":"57305","definition":"花费的时间不长地。","pronunciation":["빨리"]},{"id":"b96e814e821f04ed","term":"급식","zh":"供应伙食，供餐，供食","audio":"/audio/b96e814e821f04ede4f1.mp3","entryId":"41410","definition":"在机关内为一定的对象提供饮食；或所那些饮食。","pronunciation":["급씩"]},{"id":"4692cef5ac69eb37","term":"시간","zh":"时间","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3","entryId":"62841","definition":"为了做某事而定下的时刻；或指一天中的某个时刻。","pronunciation":["시간"]},{"id":"9